NT Guru is a multiple layered typeface especially designed for display use. To create beautiful typographic designs the possibilities are endless by using layers and colors. A beautiful set of arrows and multiple language support makes Guru complete for any unique and ornamental design.&lt;br&gt;
Available on July 15th 2013 via the website.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20150317075341/http:/www.novotypo.nl/" title="www.novotypo.nl"&gt;www.novotypo.nl&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Nt Guru is a set of 5 fonts designed by Novo Typo (typo)graphic designers from Amsterdam - The Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Sjiq by Novo Typo</title><link>https://jolg42.github.io/typophile/100340/</link><pubDate>Mon, 04 Feb 2013 07:20:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://jolg42.github.io/typophile/100340/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Sjiq, a new typeface by Novo Typo – (type)designers from Amsterdam, The Netherlands.&lt;br&gt;
